# Forge Analytics (spec 057, experimental) — query side only.
#
# The write side needs nothing here: pageviews go straight to the `ANALYTICS` binding declared in
# wrangler.toml. These two are only needed to make `GET /api/analytics/summary` return real data
# locally via `wrangler pages dev --local-protocol https` or similar; without them the admin
# dashboard renders its "not configured" state instead of erroring.
#
# CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID: your Cloudflare account id (dashboard sidebar).
# CLOUDFLARE_ANALYTICS_TOKEN: an API token scoped to Account > Account Analytics > Read.
#
# Copy this file to .dev.vars (git-ignored) and fill in real values. Never commit real secrets.
CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=
CLOUDFLARE_ANALYTICS_TOKEN=
